{"seq":17,"slug":"ios-swiftui-advanced","title":"SwiftUI 进阶","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced","rating":{"composite":4.08,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"swiftui-进阶实战\">SwiftUI 进阶实战</h1><p>SwiftUI 从 2019 年问世至今已迭代至第六个大版本（SwiftUI 6，随 iOS 18 / Xcode 16 发布），在状态管理、布局系统、动画引擎和跨平台能力上发生了质变。本 hub 聚焦于「已经掌握基础 SwiftUI 声明式开发，需要在真实生产环境中构建可维护、高性能应用」的开发者——你不需要再回顾 @State 和 VStack 是什么，而是要理解 @Observable 宏的编译器展开逻辑、TCA 如何用 Reducer 组合副作用、Layout Protocol 的测量-布局两阶段协议，以及如何在 visionOS 上渲染沉浸式空间。</p>\n<p>与本分类下兄弟 hub 的分工边界如下：「SwiftUI 深入」（02_swiftui-in-depth）覆盖框架本身的机制原理——View Protocol、数据流、布局、动画和互操作基础；「Swift 语言进阶」（03_swift-language-advanced）聚焦语言层面——泛型、协议、并发模型、宏；「iOS 架构」（04_ios-architecture）讨论架构模式与模块化设计。本 hub 站在这三者之上，将语言能力和框架机制组合成生产级的应用实践：架构选型如何落地到 SwiftUI 视图树、渲染性能调优如何与 View Identity 机制联动、多平台集成如何桥接 UIKit 与 visionOS、测试策略如何覆盖声明式 UI 的行为验证。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径（按章节顺序）：先从「架构」章节建立状态管理与导航的整体认知，再进入「渲染」章节掌握布局与动画的进阶技法，接着通过「集成」章节学习跨框架与跨平台的桥接方案，最后用「测试」章节补齐质量保障环节。如果你已有 TCA 经验，可直接跳到渲染章节；如果你正在评估 visionOS 适配，集成章节第三篇是独立入口。</p>\n<p>前置知识：熟悉 SwiftUI 基础（View / Modifier / @State / @Binding / NavigationStack）、Swift 5.9+ 语法（宏、Result Builder、async/await）、Xcode 16 开发环境。建议先完成「SwiftUI 深入」hub 中的数据流与布局章节。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"architecture","title":"架构与状态管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"observable-state-management","title":"@Observable 宏与精准状态追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/architecture/observable-state-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"tca-composable-architecture","title":"TCA 组合式架构实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/architecture/tca-composable-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"navigation-architecture","title":"类型安全导航架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/architecture/navigation-architecture"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"rendering","title":"渲染与动画进阶","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/rendering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"custom-layout-protocol","title":"自定义 Layout Protocol 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/rendering/custom-layout-protocol"},{"seq":2,"slug":"advanced-animations","title":"进阶动画与视觉编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/rendering/advanced-animations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rendering-performance","title":"渲染性能调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/rendering/rendering-performance"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"integration","title":"跨框架与多平台集成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"swiftdata-integration","title":"SwiftData 持久化集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/integration/swiftdata-integration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"uikit-interop-patterns","title":"UIKit 互操作模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/integration/uikit-interop-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"visionos-spatial-ui","title":"visionOS 空间 UI 开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/integration/visionos-spatial-ui"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"testing","title":"测试与质量保障","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/testing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"preview-driven-development","title":"Preview 驱动开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/testing/preview-driven-development"},{"seq":2,"slug":"snapshot-and-ui-testing","title":"快照测试与 UI 自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/testing/snapshot-and-ui-testing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"testable-architecture-patterns","title":"可测试架构模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-swiftui-advanced/testing/testable-architecture-patterns"}]}]}